# DEPRECATED — Do NOT use this file

This file is a legacy artifact and is no longer maintained.
It contained outdated references to Next.js 14, Drizzle/Prisma, and `__tests__/`.

**The project currently uses:**
- Next.js 16 (App Router)
- Supabase (PostgreSQL, no ORM — direct `supabase-js` / `@supabase/ssr`)
- Tests in `tests/` (Vitest for unit, Playwright for E2E)

**Authoritative sources:**
- `.cursor/rules/000-core-kernel.mdc` — Project kernel (always-on law)
- `.cursor/rules/ci-quality-enforcement.mdc` — CI & quality gates
- `.cursor/skills/SKILLS_APPLICATION_GUIDE.md` — Skills index
- `.cursor/release-gate.prompt.md` — Release gate supreme law
